---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How to Book Navagraha Homam | Nagayakshi Temple">

  <section class="booking-hero">
    <div class="booking-hero-content">
      <span class="booking-badge">Rahu Peyarchi &#8211; Special Homam</span>
      <h1>How to Book Navagraha Homam</h1>
      <p class="booking-tagline">December 5, 2026 &#8211; four simple steps to reserve your place</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="booking-section">
    <div class="booking-container">

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">1</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Make Your Payment &#8211; &#8377;10,000</h4>
          <p>Pay using either UPI or Netbanking.</p>
          <div class="payment-options">
            <div class="payment-card">
              <h5>UPI</h5>
              <ul class="payment-detail-list">
                <li><span>UPI Number</span><strong>+91 88915 46004</strong></li>
                <li><span>Name</span><strong>SHANKARODATH KOVILAKAM</strong></li>
                <li><span>Banking Name</span><strong>Manavendravarma Yoga</strong></li>
                <li><span>Amount</span><strong>&#8377;10,000</strong></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="payment-card">
              <h5>Netbanking</h5>
              <ul class="payment-detail-list">
                <li><span>Account No.</span><strong>110122231114</strong></li>
                <li><span>Bank</span><strong>Canara Bank</strong></li>
                <li><span>Branch</span><strong>Puthur Branch</strong></li>
                <li><span>IFSC Code</span><strong>CNRB0014460</strong></li>
                <li><span>Amount</span><strong>&#8377;10,000</strong></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">2</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Send Your Payment Screenshot on WhatsApp</h4>
          <p>Message the temple&#8217;s WhatsApp number at <strong>+91 99463 73522</strong> with a screenshot of your payment, along with:</p>
          <ul class="info-list">
            <li>Your Name</li>
            <li>Nakshatra</li>
            <li>Pooja Name: <strong>Navagraha Homam</strong></li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://wa.me/919946373522" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-whatsapp">Message on WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">3</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>Receive Your Receipt</h4>
          <p>The temple will send you a receipt on the same WhatsApp number, confirming your booking.</p>
          <p class="step-note">All pooja items are included in the &#8377;10,000&#8212;there&#8217;s no need to buy anything extra.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">4</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h4>On the Day &#8212; December 5, 2026</h4>
          <p>Please arrive by <strong>9:30 AM</strong>. Show the soft copy of your receipt at the temple office when you arrive, and collect your original receipt there.</p>
          <p>Navagraha Homam is performed one graha (planet) at a time, so the ceremony runs through the day. Please plan to stay until around <strong>7:00 PM</strong>, and avoid booking onward travel or flight tickets before then.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="booking-help">
        <h3>Need Help?</h3>
        <p>Call or message the temple office directly for any questions about your booking.</p>
        <div class="booking-help-buttons">
          <a href="tel:+919946373522" class="btn-primary-gold">Call: +91 9946373522</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/919946373522" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-whatsapp">WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
        <a href="/poojas/navagraha-homam" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Navagraha Homam</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.booking-hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--laterite-dark) 0%, var(--laterite-red) 100%);
  padding: 7rem 2rem 4rem;
  text-align: center;
}
.booking-hero-content { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
.booking-badge { display: inline-block; background: var(--gold); color: var(--laterite-dark); padding: 0.45rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
.booking-hero h1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: white; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
.booking-tagline { font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }

.booking-section { padding: 4.5rem 2rem; background: var(--bg-base); }
.booking-container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }

.step {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  padding: 1.8rem;
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.step-number {
  width: 50px;
  height: 50px;
  background: var(--laterite-red);
  color: white;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.step-content { min-width: 0; }
.step-content h4 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--laterite-red);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.step-content p {
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}
.step-content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.step-note { font-weight: 700; color: var(--emerald-dark); }

.info-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
.info-list li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.4rem; position: relative; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
.info-list li::before { content: '\2713'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--laterite-red); font-weight: 700; }

.payment-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
.payment-card { background: var(--bg-base); border: 2px solid #e8c9a0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; }
.payment-card h5 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--laterite-red); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
.payment-detail-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
.payment-detail-list li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); font-size: 0.92rem; }
.payment-detail-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.payment-detail-list span { color: var(--text-muted); }
.payment-detail-list strong { color: var(--laterite-dark); text-align: right; }

.btn-whatsapp {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #25d366;
  color: white;
  padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
  border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}
.btn-whatsapp:hover { background: #1ebc59; transform: translateY(-2px); }

.booking-help { text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; background: var(--bg-alt); border-radius: 14px; }
.booking-help h3 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--laterite-red); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
.booking-help p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.booking-help-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.back-link { color: var(--laterite-red); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; }
.back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .booking-hero h1 { font-size: 2.1rem; }
  .step { flex-direction: column; }
  .payment-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
